/Previously_Off_the_beaten_path\" title=\"Previously Off the beaten path\">Off the Beaten Path</a></h2>\n        <section data-mw-section-id=\"-1\" id=\"mwKQ\" aria-labelledby=\"Great_Barrier_Island\"><h3 style=\"font-size:2em;\" id=\"Great_Barrier_Island\" class=\"mw-html-heading\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"//en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Great_Barrier_Island\" title=\"Great Barrier Island\">Great Barrier Island</a></h3>\n\t\t<div class=\"quote\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"//en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Great_Barrier_Island\" title=\"Great Barrier Island\">With a history of mining and logging, highlights of the Great Barrier Island include hiking through kauri forests, white sand beaches and surfing.</a></div>\n\t</section></section></div>\n\t<p><span class=\"nolink\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\" data-mw=\"{&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Great Barrier Island&quot;}\"><span title=\"Great Barrier Island\"><img alt=\"Great Barrier Island\" resource=\"//en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/File:Great_Barrier_MP_banner_Aotea_Arts_and_History_Village.jpg\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Great_Barrier_MP_banner_Aotea_Arts_and_History_Village.jpg/1920px-Great_Barrier_MP_banner_Aotea_Arts_and_History_Village.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" data-file-width=\"4896\" data-file-height=\"1638\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"569\" width=\"1700\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Great_Barrier_MP_banner_Aotea_Arts_and_History_Village.jpg/3840px-Great_Barrier_MP_banner_Aotea_Arts_and_History_Village.jpg 1.5x, //upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Great_Barrier_MP_banner_Aotea_Arts_and_History_Village.jpg/3840px-Great_Barrier_MP_banner_Aotea_Arts_and_History_Village.jpg 2x\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></span></span>\n\t<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\" data-mw=\"{&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Great Barrier Island&quot;}\"><a href=\"//en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Great_Barrier_Island\" title=\"Great Barrier Island\"><img alt=\"Great Barrier Island\" res