opics\">Featured Travel Topic</a></h2>\n        <section data-mw-section-id=\"-1\" id=\"mwLg\" aria-labelledby=\"Tagalog_phrasebook\"><h3 style=\"font-size:2em;\" id=\"Tagalog_phrasebook\" class=\"mw-html-heading\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"//en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Tagalog_phrasebook\" title=\"Tagalog phrasebook\">Tagalog phrasebook</a></h3>\n\t\t<div class=\"quote\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"//en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Tagalog_phrasebook\" title=\"Tagalog phrasebook\">Some Tagalog can come in handy if planning a trip to the Philippines, which isn't the most touristy part of Southeast Asia.</a></div>\n\t</section></section></div>\n\t<p><span class=\"nolink\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\" data-mw=\"{&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Tagalog phrasebook&quot;}\"><span title=\"Tagalog phrasebook\"><img alt=\"Tagalog phrasebook\" resource=\"//en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/File:TagalogBanner1.jpg\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikivoyage/en/thumb/5/5a/TagalogBanner1.jpg/1710px-TagalogBanner1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" data-file-width=\"1710\" data-file-height=\"570\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"567\" width=\"1700\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikivoyage/en/5/5a/TagalogBanner1.jpg 1.5x, //upload.wikimedia.org/wikivoyage/en/5/5a/TagalogBanner1.jpg 2x\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></span></span>\n\t<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\" data-mw=\"{&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Tagalog phrasebook&quot;}\"><a href=\"//en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Tagalog_phrasebook\" title=\"Tagalog phrasebook\"><img alt=\"Tagalog phrasebook\" resource=\"//en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/File:TagalogBanner1.jpg\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikivoyage/en/thumb/5/5a/TagalogBanner1.jpg/1710px-TagalogBanner1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" data-file-width=\"1710\" data-file-height=\"570\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"567\" width=\"1700\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikivoyage/en/5/5a/TagalogBanner1.jpg 1.5x, //upload.wikimedia.org/wikivoyage/en/5/5a/TagalogBanner1.jpg 2x\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></p>\n</d